WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:04.737
- THIS WEED
IS MAD TIGHT, YO.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.274
- YEAH, MAN,
I'M SUPER HIGH, DOG.

00:00:08.307 --> 00:00:10.576
- AH.

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:12.245
HEY, YO.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.614
LET ME "AX" YOU A QUESTION
ON THE REAL.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.616
- YEAH, YEAH, DOG.
YEAH, GO AHEAD, MAN.

00:00:19.718 --> 00:00:22.221
- HEY, MAN,
WHERE MY DOOKIE GO?

00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:24.090
- [chuckles]

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.762
OH.

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:31.130
WHAT?

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:33.166
- MY DOOKIE.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.401
WHERE DO IT GO?

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:36.836
- IT GO DOWN IN THE TOILET,
[bleep], YOU KNOW THAT.

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:38.704
- NAH, MAN.

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:41.507
I AIN'T STUPID.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.276
WHERE DO IT GO AFTER THAT?

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.644
- COME ON, MAN, QUIT PLAYING.
I DON'T KNOW.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:48.181
IT--IT GOES DOWN THE SEWER,
YOU KNOW.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.583
- EVERYBODY'S GO DOWN THERE?

00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:53.186
- YEAH, EVERYBODY'S DOOKIE
GOES DOWN IN THE SEWER.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.560
- WHERE MY DOOKIE GO
AFTER THAT?

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:01.794
- [scoffs]

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:04.831
IT WASHES OUT TO THE OCEAN.

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:05.865
I GUESS.

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:09.368
- HOLD UP, HOLD UP.

00:01:09.401 --> 00:01:11.871
DOLPHINS SWIM
WITH MY DOOKIE?

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:13.473
- I DON'T KNOW, MAN.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.208
I MEAN, I DON'T--
I REALLY DON'T KNOW.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.876
- WE'RE IN THE OCEAN...
- YEP.

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:18.611
- WHAT HAPPENS
TO THE DOOKIE?

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:20.480
- I'M JUST TAKING A STAB AT--
LIKE A WILD GUESS,

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.881
ALL RIGHT,

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:24.383
THAT THE DOOKIE, LIKE,
PROBABLY GO UP IN THE AIR

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:26.252
AND, LIKE, EVAPORATES
AND THEN TURNS INTO A CLOUD

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:27.286
OR SOME [bleep].

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:29.355
- A DOOKIE CLOUD.

00:01:29.388 --> 00:01:31.224
- OH, THIS [bleep].

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:34.160
- EVERYBODY'S DOOKIE
MIX UP,

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.229
GOES UP INTO A CLOUD,

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.663
AND THEN IT RAINS DOWN.

00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:39.232
THAT'S GANGSTA.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:40.366
- I JUST--
CAN WE STOP TALKING

00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:43.903
ABOUT DOOKIE RIGHT NOW?

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:45.304
- I JUST THOUGHT OF SOMETHING.

00:01:45.337 --> 00:01:46.772
- YES? WHAT IS IT?
WHAT IS IT, LEVI?

00:01:46.805 --> 00:01:48.207
- THE PIECES OF MY DOOKIE...

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.809
- YEP?
- FALLS ON THE GROUND...

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:50.910
- THAT'S TRUE, YEP.

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:52.645
- AND BECOMES A PLANT.

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:54.247
- OKAY, OKAY, THAT'S GOOD.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.281
NOW WE'RE DONE
WITH THE DOOKIE TALK, RIGHT?

00:01:55.314 --> 00:01:57.583
- A DOOKIE PLANT...
- NO.

00:01:57.616 --> 00:02:01.521
- THAT REACHES
TOWARDS THE SKY.

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:04.357
AHH.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.759
HEY, SED.

00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:08.561
- YEAH, LEVI?

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:12.865
- MAYBE IF MY DOOKIE
CAN MAKE IT OUT OF THE HOOD...

00:02:12.898 --> 00:02:17.336
MAYBE WE CAN TOO.

00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:20.306
- HUH.

00:02:22.474 --> 00:02:24.911
MAYBE.

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:25.944
MAYBE, LEVI.

